="1" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;overflow=hidden;rounded=0;" value="&lt;h1 style=&quot;margin-top: 0px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;In caz ca paroloa sa introdus gresit de 6 ori seifu va suna o alarma prin buzzer!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;Alarma se dezactiveaza la introducerea unui cod corect dupa 5min de asteptare sau direct cu cartele RFID.&lt;br&gt;Deci va exista inca trei interfete:&lt;br&gt;1. ALRAMA cu timer de 5min&lt;br&gt;2. Introduceti cod (dupa timerul de 5min) cu AVERTIZARE pe ecran&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;3. ALARMA DEZACTIVATA daca fie sa introdus parola dupa 5 min sau direct cu cardul RFID , dureaza 5 sec&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 32px;&quot;&gt;4. Iar dupa Deschidere seif etc...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;" vertex="1"><mxGeometry height="510" width="940" x="430" y="1450" as="geometry"/></mxCell></root></mxGraphModel></diagram></mxfile>